<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>BALTAP - Hunting in Skagerrak, 1983</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;The Soviet offensive is&amp;nbsp;rolling over Denmark. They hit our naval&amp;nbsp;forces in southern Norway and&amp;nbsp;took out the coastal radar stations in Denmark and&amp;nbsp;southern Norway. Currently&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;hostilities calmed down and&amp;nbsp;there is no indication that they&amp;nbsp;intend to&amp;nbsp;invade southern Norway.&amp;nbsp;Hence most of our available forces are disposed&amp;nbsp;to defend&amp;nbsp;northern Norway. 
&lt;P&gt;A Soviet task group consisting of a Sverdlov-class cruiser, two oilers and several escorts is underway from the&amp;nbsp;Baltic Sea to North Sea.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Destroy&amp;nbsp;the Soviet cruiser and the oilers before they can reach the North Sea. They must not team up with other Soviet naval forces currently operating in North Sea.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>2</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>3</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>Skagerrak</ScenSetting>
